1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,220
Man: What main dish should we prepare for our dinner party this weekend?

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,660
Woman: The steak we ate at your parents' place last week was fabulous

3
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,120
We could do something similar.

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,800
Man: Hmm, I don't think the Johnsons eat meat

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,090
I was thinking more along the lines of veggie lasagna.

6
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:19,090
Woman: Oh, I do have a great recipe for that actually.

7
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:20,280
Man: We have a winner then

8
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:23,150
I'll need the list of ingredients for my trip to the supermarket tonight.
